Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:04.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:04.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  莫妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.47,0:00:07.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it okay if I bring someone to your parents' anniversary party?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.47,0:00:07.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以带人去参加你爸妈的结婚周年派对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.37,0:00:08.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Sure.  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.37,0:00:08.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题  好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:09.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:09.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要带谁去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:12.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His name is Parker, and I met him at the cleaners.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:12.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他叫派克  我们在洗衣店里认识的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:15.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did he put a little starch in your bloomers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:15.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他在你外套里放了点浆糊吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:19.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.06,0:00:19.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是谁说的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.42,0:00:22.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, he's really great, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.42,0:00:22.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是  但他人真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:25.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He has this incredible zest for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:25.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他对生命异常热忱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.51,0:00:27.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He treats me like a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.51,0:00:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他把我当女王一样对待
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:30.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Except at night when he treats me like the naughty girl I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:30.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过他晚上在床上会把我当作淘气少女
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, would it be okay if I give the toast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了  今年由我来向爸妈致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:35.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to mom and dad this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:35.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:38.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you sure you want to after what happened at their 20th?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:38.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}经历过20周年纪念日的意外后  你还是想吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:40.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. I'd really like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:40.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的很想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.05,0:00:42.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, hopefully this time Mom won't boo you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.05,0:00:42.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}希望这次妈不会嘘你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.55,0:00:46.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes! Every year Ross makes the toast,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.55,0:00:46.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了  每年都是罗斯致词
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.02,0:00:48.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and it's always really moving, and always makes them cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.02,0:00:48.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的话总能把大家感动得痛哭流涕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.91,0:00:51.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This year, I'm gonna make them cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.91,0:00:51.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今年  我要把他们弄哭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:54.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You wonder why Ross is their favorite?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:54.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还不知道他们为什么最爱罗斯吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.02,0:00:57.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, really. Any time Ross makes a toast,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.02,0:00:57.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是  只要罗斯一致词
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.02,0:01:00.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}everyone cries and hugs him and pats him on the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.02,0:01:00.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家都会哭着拥抱他  拍他的背
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:05.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And they all come up to me and say, "God, your brother."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.33,0:01:05.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们都会走过来跟我说"天啊  你哥哥"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.30,0:01:07.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what they're gonna say this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.30,0:01:07.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道今天他们今年会怎么说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:09.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"God, you."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:09.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"天啊  你"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:14.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I can promise you, at least one person will be crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:14.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我向你保证至少有一个人会哭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.38,0:01:18.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm an actor, and any actor worth his salt can cry on cue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.38,0:01:18.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是演员  每个称职的演员都是想哭就哭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.61,0:01:19.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? You can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.61,0:01:19.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  你做得到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.97,0:01:22.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you kidding me? Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.97,0:01:22.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开什么玩笑  看着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.73,0:01:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I can't do it with you guys watching me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.73,0:01:35.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们都盯着我看  我哭不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.38,0:01:38.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S08E18 The One In Massapequa
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.38,0:01:38.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第八季  第18集  盖勒夫妇的结婚纪念日
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:19.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What are you doing?  I'm working on my toast for the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:19.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在做什么  我在写我的演讲稿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:23.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or as I like to call it: "Sobfest 2002."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:23.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我称之为"2002年最佳催泪弹"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.69,0:02:26.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Hey, check this out.  It's a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.69,0:02:26.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看  是只小狗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a dead dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是只死狗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:32.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's ChiChi. She died when I was in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:32.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是琪琪  在我高中时死掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.85,0:02:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's your parents' anniversary
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.85,0:02:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要在父母的结婚纪念日上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:35.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and you're going to talk about their dead pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:35.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谈一只死狗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.65,0:02:37.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's good stuff, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.65,0:02:37.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个素材不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:44.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey? You got a present for my parents? That's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:44.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  你准备好要送我爸妈的礼物了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:46.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. In honor of their 35th wedding anniversary,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:46.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  为了纪念他们结婚35周年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.94,0:02:49.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had a star named after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.94,0:02:49.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我用他们的名字为一颗星星命名
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:50.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:50.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那简直太酷了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.68,0:02:54.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I got them a book on Kama Sutra for the Elderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.68,0:02:54.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还给他们买了老年人的性爱宝典
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.66,0:02:58.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you guys have any extra ribbon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.66,0:02:58.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们有多余的缎带吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.48,0:02:59.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Sure. What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.48,0:02:59.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然有  你要什么样的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:02.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We got lace, satin, sateen,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:02.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们有蕾丝  缎子  棉缎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.49,0:03:05.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}raffia, gingham, felt...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.49,0:03:05.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}酒椰纤维  条纹布  毛毡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.95,0:03:09.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I think my testicles may be in here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.95,0:03:09.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我的蛋蛋应该也放在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.17,0:03:17.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ChiChi! Oh, I loved this dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.17,0:03:17.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}琪琪  我爱死这只狗了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:22.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica couldn't get braces because ChiChi needed knee surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:22.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡没装牙套是因为琪琪得动膝盖手术
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:24.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:24.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.72,0:03:28.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're the 200pounder 11yearold who rode her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.72,0:03:28.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是你这个两百磅的大胖子骑着它到处跑的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.63,0:03:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey! Everybody, this is Parker. Parker, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.63,0:03:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大伙们  他是派克  派克  这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:37.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:37.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  别告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:41.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me guess: Joey, Monica, Ross, Rachel...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:41.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我猜  乔伊  莫妮卡  罗斯  瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I'm sorry, Phoebe didn't mention you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:44.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起  菲比没有提过你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.73,0:03:48.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler, I'm kidding! Already you're my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.73,0:03:48.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒  我开玩笑呢  你已经是我的最爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:51.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't all of you tell me a little about your self?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:51.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟我谈谈你们自己的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.90,0:03:55.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, I'm sorry. We probably should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.90,0:03:55.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上我们该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:03:58.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Classic Ross!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:03:58.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}典型的罗斯作风
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:04.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel, look how you glow! May I ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:04.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋  你好漂亮  我可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:06.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think you already are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:06.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你已经不请自来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.88,0:04:10.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rachel, you have life growing inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.88,0:04:10.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋  你体内孕育着一个小生命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:13.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there anything in this world more miraculous...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这世上还有什么更神奇...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:16.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A picture of a dog! Whose is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:16.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一张狗狗照片  这是谁的狗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.64,0:04:20.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's my old dog. He passed away years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.64,0:04:20.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我家以前养的狗  它已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:23.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, at least you were lucky to have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:23.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少你很幸运能拥有它
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:27.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bowwow, old friend. Bowwow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:27.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}汪汪  我的老朋友  汪汪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:30.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So where's the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.29,0:04:30.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}派对在哪里举行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:32.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's out on the island. It's in Massapequa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:32.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在岛上的马沙皮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.43,0:04:35.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Massapequa, it sounds like a magical place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.43,0:04:35.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马沙皮卡  听起来像个神奇的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.68,0:04:36.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell me about Massapequa,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.68,0:04:36.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟我介绍一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.73,0:04:38.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}is it steeped in Native American history?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.73,0:04:38.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它是美国原住民历史上的名胜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:41.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, there is an Arby's in the shape of a tepee.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:41.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那里有原住民帐篷形状的艾比餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.83,0:04:44.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've got my note cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.83,0:04:44.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我拿了题词卡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} You got the presents?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:45.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你拿礼物了吗  拿了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:47.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} And I've got the car keys.  We're driving?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:47.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我拿车钥匙了  我们要开车吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Yeah.  Aces.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.48,0:04:56.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} So he seems like a nice guy.  Yeah, I like him a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.48,0:04:56.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他似乎是个好人  对  我很喜欢他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.83,0:04:58.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want to hang back and take our own cab?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.83,0:04:58.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想拖延一会去搭计程车吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, otherwise I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然  不然我就不去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:14.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Hey, Mom.  This is such a great party!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:14.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈  这个派对简直太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.19,0:05:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thirtyfive years. Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.19,0:05:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三十五年  令人佩服
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:19.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you have any pearls of wisdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:19.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们有什么婚姻的至理名言吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.43,0:05:23.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Jack?  Why would you serve food on such a sharp stick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.43,0:05:23.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}杰克  食物上为什么要插这么尖的牙签
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:28.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a good question, Dad. It's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:28.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个问题不错  爸爸  这个问题不错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:33.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Congratulations, you two.  Thank you, we're so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:33.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恭喜你们  谢谢  我们很兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.91,0:05:37.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And also, congratulations on your wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.91,0:05:37.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还要恭喜你们结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:42.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Can we talk to you for just a moment?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:42.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们能跟你们谈一下吗  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:46.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just a little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:46.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这只是件小事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:48.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}While we think it's simply marvelous
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:48.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们觉得你们未婚生子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.53,0:05:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that you're having this baby out of wedlock...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.53,0:05:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完全没有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:55.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}some of our friends are less openminded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:55.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们有些朋友思想没有那么开放
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.90,0:05:58.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Which is why we told them you're married.  What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.90,0:05:58.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我们告诉他们你们结婚了  什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.34,0:06:01.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for going along with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.34,0:06:01.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你们愿意配合
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:04.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dad, we have to pretend that we're married?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爸  我们得假装我们结婚了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:06.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Son, I had to shave my ears for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:06.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}儿子  我为了今晚专门剃了耳毛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:08.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.98,0:06:08.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这件事你也能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:12.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Can you believe that?  I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:12.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能相信吗  就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.15,0:06:16.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you do the ears, you may as well take a pass at the nosal area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.15,0:06:16.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然剃了耳毛  就不能连鼻毛一起处理一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:20.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. I don't want to have to lie about us being married.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:20.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想撒谎说我们结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:21.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I know. I don't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:21.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也不想
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:24.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you know what ? It's their party, and it's one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:24.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但这是他们的派对  而且仅此一晚而己
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:27.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We don't have to lie. We just won't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:27.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不必说谎  我们只要不说话就行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:30.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it comes up again, we'll just smile, we'll nod along...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:30.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果有人提起  我们只要微笑点头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.69,0:06:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Ross?  Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.69,0:06:32.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:34.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Aunt Lisa. Uncle Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:34.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨  丽莎阿姨  丹叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:39.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Congratulations on the baby and on the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:39.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恭喜你们怀孕  还结了婚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.93,0:06:44.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's a little something to get you started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.93,0:06:44.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这算是送你们的新婚礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.56,0:06:47.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how's married life treating you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.56,0:06:47.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们的婚后生活过得如何
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:50.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Unbelievable. It's great!  We love marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:50.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不可思议  太棒了  我们可喜欢结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.52,0:06:52.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.52,0:06:52.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}待会见
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:58.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What a beautiful place. What a great night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好漂亮的地方  好棒的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:06:59.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:06:59.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得告诉你们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.47,0:07:02.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}being here with all of you in Event Room C...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.47,0:07:02.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能跟你们一起待在C宴会厅
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:09.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I feel so lucky. Think of the good times that happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.56,0:07:09.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得好幸运  想想这里曾有过的美好时光
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.02,0:07:13.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The birthdays, the proms, the mitzvahs, both bar and bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.02,0:07:13.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}生日  毕业舞会  犹太教成人礼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But none of them will compare with tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但任凭什么都比不上今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.32,0:07:19.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My God, I don't want to forget this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.32,0:07:19.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  我想铭记这个瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.35,0:07:22.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like I want to take a mental picture of you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.35,0:07:22.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要在脑海中帮你们拍张照
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.79,0:07:24.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Click.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.79,0:07:24.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}咔嚓
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:27.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't think the flash went off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:27.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得闪光灯没开
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.79,0:07:33.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna find the men's room. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.79,0:07:33.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要去趟洗手间  马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:34.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I'll go with you.  Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:34.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟你一起去  快来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:37.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Somewhere there is someone with a tranquilizer gun...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:37.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人躲在某个地方端着麻醉枪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.30,0:07:40.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and a huge butterfly net looking for that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.30,0:07:40.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}握着大蝴蝶网  在找那个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.81,0:07:43.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to go to the bathroom too,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.81,0:07:43.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也想上厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:45.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but I don't want him complimenting my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:45.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我不想让他夸奖我的小弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.84,0:07:49.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So glad we weren't in the car. Did he ever let up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.84,0:07:49.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还好我们没在车上  他有安静的时候吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He called the Long Island Expressway a "concrete miracle."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他称长岛高速公路为"水泥奇迹"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.53,0:07:57.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This room. This night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.53,0:07:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个房间  这个夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:08:00.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That waiter! His shoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:08:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个服务生  他的鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.24,0:08:03.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I must take a mental picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.24,0:08:03.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要在脑海中拍张照
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.09,0:08:05.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.09,0:08:05.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.33,0:08:12.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Were you guys making fun of Parker?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.33,0:08:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们在取笑派克吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:15.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That depends, how much did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.92,0:08:15.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那得看你听到了多少
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's a little enthusiastic. What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:20.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是有点狂热  可那有什么不对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:24.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} It's so much.  Well, so what? I like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:24.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他太过火了  那又怎么样  我喜欢他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.39,0:08:26.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do I make fun of the people you've dated?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.39,0:08:26.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会取笑你们的约会对象吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:29.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tag, Janice, Mona.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:29.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}泰格  珍妮丝  蒙娜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.03,0:08:31.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, because friends don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.03,0:08:31.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  因为朋友不会那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:33.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But do you want my opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:33.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们想知道我的想法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.15,0:08:34.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you want it? 'Cause in my opinion,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.15,0:08:34.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}依我看来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.60,0:08:36.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}your collective dating record
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.60,0:08:36.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们的约会纪录加起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:39.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}reads like a who's who of human crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:39.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}基本等同于人渣史
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:44.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I feel terrible.  I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:44.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得好内疚  我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.97,0:08:48.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What was wrong with Mona?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.97,0:08:48.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蒙娜有哪里不好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.49,0:08:56.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Open it, open it, open it.  Yeah, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.49,0:08:56.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快打开  好耶  宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:09:00.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So we never got to hear about your wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:09:00.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都没听说你们举办了婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:02.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were surprised we weren't invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:02.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们很讶异自己没有受到邀请
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:05.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no, it was just our parents and 1 or 2 friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:05.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  只有我们父母和几位亲友参加
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.97,0:09:07.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was a small wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.97,0:09:07.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}婚礼的规模很小
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:08.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:08.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但场面很美
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:11.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was small, but kind of spectacular.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:11.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}婚礼虽小  一应俱全
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.68,0:09:12.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where did you have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.68,0:09:12.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们在哪里举行的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.79,0:09:16.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On a cliff in Barbados, at sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.79,0:09:16.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在巴巴多斯悬崖上的黄昏婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.92,0:09:21.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And Stevie Wonder sang "Isn't She Lovely" as I walked down the aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.92,0:09:21.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我走上红毯时  史提夫·汪达唱着《她真美》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.23,0:09:24.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Really?  Yeah. Stevie's a family friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.23,0:09:24.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  史提夫是我们家的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:26.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. That sounds amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:26.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  那真的是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.53,0:09:29.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I'd love to see pictures.  Yeah, so would I.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.53,0:09:29.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想看照片  对  我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.69,0:09:32.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You wouldn't think Annie Liebowitz
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.69,0:09:32.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们不会相信安妮·莱波维兹
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:35.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}would forget to put film in the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:35.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会忘了装底片
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.46,0:09:40.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you excuse us for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.46,0:09:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请允许我们失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.97,0:09:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.97,0:09:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这是要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:45.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? I'm not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:45.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了  我又不是你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.99,0:09:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This may be my only wedding I ever have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.99,0:09:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那可能是我唯一一场婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:52.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} And I want it to be amazing.  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:52.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望婚礼很精彩  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.81,0:09:55.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe I rode in on a Harley.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.81,0:09:55.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我该骑着哈雷摩托入场
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.98,0:09:58.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Ross, it has to be realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.98,0:09:58.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  我们得编得现实一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:07.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Say, are you okay? You seem kind of quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:07.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还好吗  你一直不太讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:10.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm fine. I'm great. I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:10.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没事  我很好  我跟你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm with you. What a great time to be alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而我跟你在一起  活着真好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:17.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at this plate bouncy thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:17.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看这个送盘器
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.97,0:10:22.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What an inspired solution to man's platedispensing problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.97,0:10:22.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是个天才发明  解决了盘子分发的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:27.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Oysters! Let me feed you one.  That's not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:27.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}生蚝  让我来喂你  你不必那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.22,0:10:28.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Please?  Actually I don't eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.22,0:10:28.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托  我不吃...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:31.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I won't quit until you try one.  Okay, fine, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:31.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不吃的话我绝不罢休  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.98,0:10:36.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.98,0:10:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.55,0:10:38.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What're they like? I've never had one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.55,0:10:38.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是什么味道  我从来没吃过
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:43.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Why don't you just try one.  No, they look too weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:43.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就尝尝看  看起来太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.73,0:10:46.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.73,0:10:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.76,0:10:48.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just going over my toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.76,0:10:48.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}准备致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:50.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Those two will never know what hit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:50.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们俩绝对想不到我会说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.93,0:10:53.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't wait. They'll cry so hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.93,0:10:53.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我等不及了  他们会痛哭流涕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.57,0:10:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}they'll be fighting for breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.57,0:10:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以至于喘不过气来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.53,0:10:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you want to, I could just hold them down and you could just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.53,0:10:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你需要的话  我可以按住他们  让你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.01,0:11:06.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And my veil was lace, made by blind Belgian nuns.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.01,0:11:06.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我戴着蕾丝婚纱  由比利时盲人修女织成
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:08.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:08.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}盲人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:11.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not at first, but it's very intricate work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:11.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们本来没瞎  但这份工作非常伤眼力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:15.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They said even though they lost their sight, it's all worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:15.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她们说虽然眼睛瞎了  但还是很值得的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:19.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I bet you looked beautiful.  Well, I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:19.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我敢说你看起来很漂亮  我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:20.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But there were some people that said
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:20.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但有些宾客说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.83,0:11:23.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I looked like a floating angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.83,0:11:23.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看起来像漂浮的天使
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:26.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How did you propose?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:26.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是怎么求的婚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:28.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah, that's a great story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.21,0:11:28.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  那个故事很精彩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.48,0:11:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, actually, I took her to the planetarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.48,0:11:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上  我带她去了天文馆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:37.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's where we had our first date.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:37.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是我们第一次约会的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She walked in
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她走进来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.04,0:11:44.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and I had the room filled with lilies, her favorite flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.04,0:11:44.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在房间里铺满了她最喜欢的百合花
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.42,0:11:47.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} That is so sweet!  I want to hear the rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.42,0:11:47.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}简直太浪漫了  我还想听完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:53.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then Fred Astaire singing, "The Way You Look Tonight"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:53.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}音响系统里传出弗莱德·艾斯塔的歌声
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:56.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}came on the sound system, and the lights came down,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:56.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《你今晚的样子》  此时灯光熄灭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.49,0:11:58.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got on one knee...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.49,0:11:58.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我单脚跪地
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.06,0:12:02.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and written across the dome, in the stars, were the words:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.06,0:12:02.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}圆顶从左至右用星星拼成一行字
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.29,0:12:04.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Will you marry me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.29,0:12:04.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"你愿意嫁给我吗 "
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:08.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And the ring was the size of my fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:08.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}戒指有我的拳头那么大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:14.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Phoebe? Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:14.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  听着
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.23,0:12:19.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I want to apologize about before. Okay? We were being jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.23,0:12:19.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要对你道歉  我们太不厚道了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.97,0:12:22.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Parker's a nice guy, and I'd like to get to know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.97,0:12:22.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}派克人很好  我想多了解他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.79,0:12:24.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then you better do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.79,0:12:24.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你最好快去找他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.17,0:12:26.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Why?  Because I'm gonna kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.17,0:12:26.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么  因为我要杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.06,0:12:28.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What? What?  You guys were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.06,0:12:28.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  你们说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.95,0:12:31.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's too excited about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.95,0:12:31.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他对所有事都太热衷了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm all for living life,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也很喜欢生命
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:36.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but this is the Gellers' 35th anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:36.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但这是盖勒夫妇结婚35周年派对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:39.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's call a spade a spade. This party stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:39.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们摸着良心说话  这个派对烂透了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:41.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. I'm having the worst time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:41.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是  我简直无聊到了极点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.65,0:12:44.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There was a 15minute line for the buffet,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.65,0:12:44.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那边取自助餐要排15分钟的队
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:46.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and when I got to the plates...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等我好不容易拿到盘子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.00,0:12:48.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I slipped on a giant booger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.00,0:12:48.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果踩到一大坨鼻涕滑倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.55,0:12:53.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you sure it wasn't an oyster?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.55,0:12:53.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你确定那不是生蚝吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.49,0:12:58.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It could've been. I didn't look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.49,0:12:58.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有可能  我没看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.37,0:13:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just wiped it on Chandler's coat and got the hell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.37,0:13:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我把它抹在钱德勒的外套上  拔腿就溜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:06.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought he was a great guy. I was so excited about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:06.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还以为他是个好人  我对他真的很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:10.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, hey, you should be excited about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:10.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿  你应该对他充满期待
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.60,0:13:12.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's nothing wrong with him. He's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.60,0:13:12.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他没有什么不对  他是个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:15.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} You think?  Yeah, you know what I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:15.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  对  你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.30,0:13:19.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I think we were all just being too negative.  You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.30,0:13:19.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都太悲观了  你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:21.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right. He's just embracing life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:21.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他只是在拥抱生命而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:24.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We could all stand to be a little more like Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:24.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都应该向派克学习
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.55,0:13:26.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? I'm like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.55,0:13:26.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗  我就跟他一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.37,0:13:28.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a sunny, positive person!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.37,0:13:28.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是个积极乐观的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:30.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, you have a little bit of an edge.
