Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.98,0:18:46.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起我把塞车形容得如此美好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:51.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't have to put a good spin on everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不必对所有事物都做美化
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:54.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. That's who I am. I'm a positive person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:54.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  我就是这样一个乐观的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.22,0:18:56.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm a positive person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.22,0:18:56.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  我才是个乐观的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.34,0:19:00.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are like Santa Claus on Prozac.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.34,0:19:00.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你像是吃了抗忧郁药的圣诞老人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.85,0:19:04.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At Disneyland, getting laid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.85,0:19:04.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在迪士尼乐园享受性爱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.47,0:19:08.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So what do you want me to do? You want me to be more negative?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.47,0:19:08.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你想要我怎样  更悲观一些吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.25,0:19:09.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want me to be less happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.25,0:19:09.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}压抑心中的快乐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.55,0:19:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Much less happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.55,0:19:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}使劲压抑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.24,0:19:16.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. Well, then to quote Ross, "I better be going."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.24,0:19:16.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  那引用罗斯的话"我最好走了"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:19.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So long!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:19.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:21.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't let the "best door in the world"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:21.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你出去的时候  别让"全世界最棒的门"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:24.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}hit you in the ass on your way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:24.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打到屁股了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.51,0:19:32.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Isn't this the most incredible fight you've had in your entire life?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.51,0:19:32.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你一辈子吵过最不可思议的一架吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.71,0:19:38.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then we could've gone from the ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.71,0:19:38.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你坐在边车里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.91,0:19:42.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to the reception with you in the sidecar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.91,0:19:42.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们从婚礼现场走到婚宴厅
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.94,0:19:45.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, it just wouldn't be feasible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.94,0:19:45.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那样行不通啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.13,0:19:48.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But a dove placing the ring on your finger
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.13,0:19:48.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}鸽子叼着戒指戴到你手上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.39,0:19:50.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}would've been no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.39,0:19:50.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就没有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:54.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was fun being married to you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚跟你结婚感觉太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.16,0:19:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, and it was the easiest 400 bucks I've ever made.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.16,0:19:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  这四百块真好赚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:02.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Okay, Ross, can I ask you something?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:02.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  我能问你一件事吗  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.88,0:20:05.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That proposal at the planetarium?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.88,0:20:05.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在天文馆求婚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.30,0:20:07.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know, I know. It was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.30,0:20:07.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道  那太蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.65,0:20:09.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.65,0:20:09.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.34,0:20:13.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With the lilies, and the song and the stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.34,0:20:13.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有百合花  那首歌  还有星星
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:17.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was really wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:17.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}简直妙不可言
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:19.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you just make that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:19.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是随便编的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.19,0:20:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I thought of it when we were going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.19,0:20:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们交往时  我想过要那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:26.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's how I imagined I would ask you to marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:26.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就是我想象中跟你求婚的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:34.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that would've been very hard to say no to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:34.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要拒绝你一定很难
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:39.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a good thing I didn't do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:39.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还好我没有那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.85,0:20:44.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because it sounds like it would have been a very expensive wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.85,0:20:44.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为听起来那会是个昂贵的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.94,0:20:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Okay, good night.  Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.94,0:20:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  晚安  晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:59.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even if the sidecar had a windscreen
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果边车有挡风玻璃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:00.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so your hair wouldn't get messed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:00.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的头发不会被吹乱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:03.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I will think about it.  That's all I'm asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:03.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会考虑的  我已经满足了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.17,0:21:10.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, that's it. I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.17,0:21:10.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  够了  我放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.57,0:21:12.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At Mom and Dad's 40th anniversary,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.57,0:21:12.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在爸妈的40周年派对上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.65,0:21:14.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you're the one giving the speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.65,0:21:14.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}由你来致词
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:16.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I don't understand why they didn't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.42,0:21:16.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不明白他们为什么没哭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:18.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was a beautiful speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:18.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的致词很感人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:21.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Come on.  All that stuff you said about true love?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:21.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}得了吧  你提到有关真爱的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.85,0:21:26.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were right. We did learn a lot from Mom and Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.85,0:21:26.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对  我们从爸妈身上学到了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.56,0:21:30.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That picture of ChiChi with her mischievous grin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.56,0:21:30.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}琪琪在照片上调皮地笑着
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.42,0:21:32.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And what you said about Nana?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.42,0:21:32.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有外婆那一段
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:36.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, she really would've wanted to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:36.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她真的会很想去参加
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.49,0:21:39.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.49,0:21:39.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.02,0:21:42.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.02,0:21:42.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想她真的去了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.67,0:21:47.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good God, Ross, how the hell do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.67,0:21:47.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  罗斯  你是怎么办到的
